The '''Olympic Stadium''' ({{Lang-bl|Estadio Olímpico}}) is a [[W:Retractable roof|retractable-roof]] [[W:Association football|football]] stadium in [[El Capitán]], [[Castejón]] that was inaugurated on 28 June 2019. It is built on the site of the former [[Castejón Dome]]. It is the largest stadium in Balisca by capacity, surpassing [[Macaio]]'s 78,000-seat [[Lagoas Stadium]].   

The stadium features a design that draws on the rich history of [[W:Moorish architecture|Moorish architecture]], blending it with striking modernity. The facade features triangles that form complex, diamond-esque geometrical patterns, appearing to change color with the sun's movement across the sky.  

